{
    "background_story": "In the mystical realm of Aethoria, Roland was a legendary bicephalous dragon, born with two fully formed heads. Each head possessed its own distinct personality: one was wise and just, while the other was fierce and impulsive. Despite their differences, the two heads worked in harmony, allowing Roland to possess unparalleled wisdom and strength. The wise head, named Arin, would often counsel the kingdom's rulers, offering sage advice on matters of state and diplomacy. Meanwhile, the fierce head, named Tharros, would lead the kingdom's armies into battle, striking fear into the hearts of their enemies. Roland's unique duality made him a revered and powerful symbol of balance and unity in Aethoria, and his legend lived on for generations to come.",
